OL,5,G1030 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe final visit is to The Royal
OL,7,     FOak Inn in Somerset, run by
OL,8,     FSpencer and Gavin. After talking a
OL,9,     Fgood game all week, the guests are
OL,10,     Fshocked to find the standards to
OL,11,     Fbe rather... standard.
OL,12,G1105 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FOn payment day, the guests rifle
OL,14,     Fthrough their feedback, from
OL,15,     Ftroubles over a breakfast hamper
OL,16,     Fto dodgy decor decisions. But at
OL,17,     Fthe end of it all, which B&B will
OL,18,     Freign supreme?
